24
00:02:01.803 --> 00:02:14.048
HNSW written from scratch reached recall 0.991 at 34x brute-force speed, and only with the paper's neighbour heuristic (0.872 without).

25
00:02:14.328 --> 00:02:23.309
Hybrid BM25 + vector ranking (RRF) was the only retriever good at both exact and healthy breakfast-style queries.

