466
00:31:07.333 --> 00:31:27.215
Goals: zero-result rate 3 %; nDCG@10 ≥ 0.85 on the judged set (≥ 500 queries); p99 150 ms for search and 50 ms for autocomplete; price or stock changes searchable within 5 s.

467
00:31:27.495 --> 00:31:31.783
