510
00:33:45.287 --> 00:33:46.482
Proposed design.

511
00:33:46.762 --> 00:33:56.767
Engine: an OpenSearch cluster, one index alias per city, 3 primaries times 2 replicas, dedicated coordinating nodes for autocomplete bursts.

512
00:33:57.047 --> 00:33:58.029
Analyzer:

513
00:33:58.309 --> 00:34:11.045
ICU normalisation, then ICU tokenizer, then Devanagari, then Latin transform, then a custom Hinglish phonetic filter, then lowercase, then a unit filter, then light plural stemming.

514
00:34:11.325 --> 00:34:14.994
