515
00:34:16.344 --> 00:34:33.112
Query: multimatch over name^2, aliases^1.5, type^3, brand, category; search-time synonyms (updateable); fuzziness AUTO:5,8; function score with popularity; stock applied by a filter or re-rank from the inventory read model.

516
00:34:33.392 --> 00:34:45.829
Indexing: the outbox, then Kafka keyed by product id, then an indexer with bulk requests ( at most 5 MB or 1,000 docs), pipelined, with external versioning on version.

517
00:34:46.109 --> 00:34:47.475
