519
00:34:50.214 --> 00:34:58.235
A judged set of 500 queries, refreshed monthly from logs, and CI that runs nDCG and the zero-result rate.

520
00:34:58.515 --> 00:35:00.905
An interleaving framework for online tests.

521
00:35:01.185 --> 00:35:04.833
A weekly zero-result review feeding aliases and synonyms.

522
00:35:05.113 --> 00:35:21.049
Hybrid (phase 2): a 384-dim multilingual embedding model on name + aliases + category, HNSW (M=16, efSearch=100), RRF with the vector weight tuned on held-out queries.

