Customers search for intents ('healthy breakfast', 'something for chai', 'party snacks'), not just products.

723
00:52:33.808 --> 00:52:37.413
Add semantic retrieval without losing exact-match quality.

724
00:52:37.693 --> 00:52:49.939
Part A builds HNSW twice (simple versus heuristic neighbour selection) over 100,000 clustered 64-dim unit vectors, and measures recall@10 against brute force.

725
00:52:51.289 --> 00:53:01.827
