894
01:06:38.929 --> 01:06:46.737
Keep synonyms in Git, run judged-query CI, and deploy with search-time synonym sets that can be reloaded and rolled back.

895
01:06:47.017 --> 01:06:47.785
5.

896
01:06:48.065 --> 01:06:49.814
Ranking by text score alone.

897
01:06:50.094 --> 01:06:53.657
Out-of-stock and unpopular items float to the top (L1:

898
01:06:53.937 --> 01:06:56.603
11 of 60 top-3 slots out of stock).

899
01:06:56.883 --> 01:07:02.259
Combine text relevance with availability and popularity in a function score, or re-rank.

900
