01:11:39.939 --> 01:11:42.691
How do you combine text relevance with business signals?

976
01:11:42.971 --> 01:11:44.337
Thirty-second answer:

977
01:11:44.617 --> 01:11:47.731
Retrieve candidates by text relevance, then adjust.

978
01:11:48.011 --> 01:11:58.422
A function score multiplies BM25 by functions of popularity, recency or margin, and availability becomes a filter or a strong demotion.

979
01:11:58.702 --> 01:12:03.417
Or re-rank the top N with a learning-to-rank model trained on clicks and purchases.

980
01:12:03.697 --> 01:12:08.689
Keep filters for hard constraints (the store's assortment), and scores for preferences.

