01:12:18.799 --> 01:12:22.106
Explain how HNSW works and how you tune it.

986
01:12:22.386 --> 01:12:23.751
Thirty-second answer:

987
01:12:24.031 --> 01:12:25.930
A multi-layer proximity graph.

988
01:12:26.210 --> 01:12:30.797
Upper layers are sparse, long-range links, and layer 0 has all nodes.

989
01:12:31.077 --> 01:12:39.183
A search greedily walks from the top entry point down, then does a best-first search with a candidate list of size efSearch on layer 0.

