01:13:40.355 --> 01:13:45.219
Lexical, vector or hybrid: how do you decide, and how do you fuse results?

1011
01:13:45.499 --> 01:13:46.864
Thirty-second answer:

1012
01:13:47.144 --> 01:13:53.309
Lexical (BM25) wins on exact tokens: brands, sizes, SKUs, rare words.

1013
01:13:53.589 --> 01:13:55.915
Vectors win on intent and paraphrase.

1014
01:13:56.195 --> 01:13:58.029
Most product search needs both.

1015
01:13:58.309 --> 01:14:06.629
Run both retrievers and fuse with reciprocal rank fusion (k about 60), weighted by retriever, or normalise scores and blend.

1016
01:14:06.909 --> 01:14:12.157
Optionally re-rank the fused top 100 with a cross-encoder or LTR model.

1017
01:14:12.437 --> 01:14:16.107
Decide weights on held-out judged queries and confirm online.

